{"id":"word:hebrew:H6629","type":"word","title":"צֹאן","subtitle":"H6629 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a collective name for a flock (of sheep or goats); also figuratively (of men)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to צֹאן (H6629) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 274 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"צֹאן (tsôʼn) means a collective name for a flock (of sheep or goats); also figuratively (of men) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 4 39."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"צֹאן","transliteration":"tsôʼn","pronunciation":"tsone","strong":"H6629","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6629","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["הַ/צֹּ֖אן","הַ/צֹּ֔אן","צֹ֥אן","הַ/צֹּ֑אן","הַ/צֹּֽאן"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncbsa",78],["HNcbsa",56],["HRd/Ncbsa",18],["HNcbsc/Sp1cs",17],["HC/Ncbsa",16],["HNcbsc",16],["HNcbsc/Sp2ms",13],["HNcbsc/Sp3ms",10],["HR/Ncbsc",7],["HNcbsc/Sp2mp",4]]},"definitions":{"short":"a collective name for a flock (of sheep or goats); also figuratively (of men)","usage":"(small) cattle, flock ( -s), lamb ( -s), sheep(-cote, -fold, -shearer, -herds).","full":"H6629. tson צאֹן 273 collective noun feminine Gen 30:36 (possibly masculine 30:39 a +, Kö Synt. § 247 g , but dubious, 30:39 b with verb feminine plural, as usually; in 1Sam 15:14 join הַוֶּה with קוֺל ; see further Albr ZAW xv (1895), 316 ff. ) small cattle, sheep and goats, flock, flocks ; — ׳צ absolute Gen 4:2 +; construct 29:9 +; suffix צאֹנוֺ 4:4 +; צאֹנֵנוּ Exod 10:9 , צאֹונֵוּ Psa 144:13 ; as plural צאֹנֵינוֺ Neh 10:37 van d. H. Gi (not Baer; very late, si vera lectio), etc.; &#8212; 1 literally a. small cattle , usually of sheep and goats in one flock (Rob BR i. 477 ) Gen 30:31-32 , +; sheep specified also 21:28 ( הַצּ ׳כִּבְשׂת ), 31:28 ( צ ׳אֵילֵי ) +; sheep only 1Sam 25:2 (+ עִוִּים ); goats specified Gen 27:9 ; Jer 50:8 ; ׳צ as yielding (1) animals for food Amos 6:4 ( בָּרִים ), 1Sam 14:32 ; 2Sam 12:4 ; Neh 5:18 +; ׳צ מַאְַבָל Psa 44:12 (in simile); (2) wool Gen 31:19 + (see [ גָּזַז ], גֵּז ); (3) milk, צ ׳חֲלֵב Deut 32:14 (? goats' milk, compare Prov 27:27 ); (4) sacrificial victims Gen 4:4 (J), Lev 1:2 , 10 ; 3:6 ; Num 15:3 (all P), 22:40 (E), Deut 12:6 , 17 , 21 + often; so קָדָשִׁים צאֹן Ezek 36:38 a, compare בְּכוֺרֵי וְצאֹנֵינוּ בְקָרֵינוּ Neh 10:37 ; in General as property (often + בָּקָר , etc.) Gen 12:16 ; 13:5 ; 24:35 ; Job 1:3 ; 42:12 + often (see also II. [ עַשְׁתָּרוֺת ]); gift Gen 20:14 ; 21:27 ; 38:17 (goat), Deut 15:14 ; 2Chr 17:11 ; booty 1Sam 15:9 , 15 + . b. ׳צ sometimes of a definite number of animals (i.e. as plural of שֶׂה , etc.): two Isa 7:21 , four Exodus 21:37 (larger numbers see 1Sam 25:2 , 5 , 18 ; Num 31:32 , 36 ; Neh 5:18 ; Job 1:3 ; 42:12 above). — See also בֵּן 7b ; עֵדֶר נָוֶה, מַרְבֵּץ, מִכְלָה, גְּדֵרָה, ; שַׁצֵר רֹצֶה, כֶלֶב, . 2 simile of multitude Ezek 36:37-38 , compare Psa 107:41 ; of children Job 21:11 ; of dead, with death as shepherd Psa 49:15 ; of (shepherdless) Israel Num 27:17 ; 1Kin 22:17 2Chr 18:16 ; Zech 10:2 ; 13:7 , wandering in sin Isa 53:6 ; of Israel led by ׳י Psalm 77:21; Psa 78:52 ; 80:2 , compare Zech 9:16 (on text see We Now); Ezek 34:12 ; of Israel in distress, ׳כְּצ טִבְחָת Psa 44:23 , compare (of wicked) ׳צ לְטִבְתָה Jer 12:3 ; of scattered Babylonian Isa 13:14 . 3 metaphor of multitude , ׳צ אָרָם Ezek 36:38 ; of Israel 2Sam 24:17 = 1Chr 21:17 ; Jer 23:1-2 , 3 ; Ezek 24:5 , and especially sustained figurative 34:2 , 317t. 34, also Zech 11:7 , 17 ; ׳צ אֹבְדוֺת Jer 50:6 , ׳צ תִּפְאַרְתֵךְ 13:20 ; of Israel under ׳י s care, ( וֺ -, יִ֯ ) ׳צ מַרְעִיתֶ֑ךָד Psa 74:1 ; 79:13 ; 100:3 ; Ezek 34:31 , also ׳צ יָדוֺ Psa 95:7 (|| מַרְעִיתוֺעַםֿ ; read perhaps יָדוֺ צַם ׳צ, מַרְעִיתוֺ , so Che and others); ׳צ נַחֲלָתֶךָ Micah 7:14 ; also in combinations: הַצֵּ ׳אַדִּירֵי Jer 25:34-35 , 36 , ׳צ חַהֲרֵגָה Zech 11:4 , 7 (compare Psa 44:23 ), הַצּ ׳עֲנִיֵּי 44:7 ; 44:11 (all of Israel); of Edom צּ הַ ׳צְעִירֵי Jer 49:20 ; 50:45 .","rootNote":"or צאוֹן ; (Psalm 144:13), from an unused root meaning to migrate ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 4 39","keyReferences":["1Chr 4 39","1Chr 4 41","1Chr 5 21","1Chr 12 41","1Chr 17 7","1Chr 21 17","1Chr 27 31","1Kgs 1 9"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":274,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 4 39","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/צֹאנָֽ/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncbsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 4 41","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":41,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/צֹאנָ֖/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncbsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 21","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/צֹ֗אן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 41","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":41,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/צֹ֖אן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 17 7","book":"1Chr","chapter":17,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/צֹּ֑אן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 21 17","book":"1Chr","chapter":21,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/צֹּ֖אן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 27 31","book":"1Chr","chapter":27,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/צֹּ֖אן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 9","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צֹ֤אן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 19","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/צֹאן֮","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 25","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/צֹאן֮","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 5 3","book":"1Kgs","chapter":5,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צֹ֑אן","source":"hebrew","morph"